  </script>
</head>

<body>
  <canvas id="viewport"></canvas>

  <div id="ui">
    <h1>Ashwing, Dragon Boss</h1>
    <p>
      Low-poly boss asset with articulated wings, tail, horns, armor,
      emissive eyes, a lava core, and two imported animation clips.
    </p>

    <div class="row">
